# Prisma migration SQL must stay LF on disk: `prisma migrate` records a
# sha256 of the file bytes when a migration is applied, and core.autocrlf
# rewriting checkouts to CRLF flips those checksums ("migration was modified
# after it was applied", offering a destructive reset). Pinning eol=lf makes
# every checkout match the applied-as-LF checksums.
prisma/migrations/**/*.sql text eol=lf
